      <h3>What is the best free QR code generator with logo support?</h3>
      <p>For a fully free, no-sign-up experience, <a href="/tool/qr-code-generator/" style="color:var(--accent);">ZippyWidgets</a> is the best choice. For vector print files, QRCode Monkey is better. For dynamic codes with analytics, Hovercode is the pick.</p>

      <h3>Do free QR codes with logos expire?</h3>
      <p>Static QR codes do not expire — the data is encoded directly into the image. Dynamic QR codes rely on the provider's redirect service, so they can stop working if the service closes or your account is deleted.</p>

      <h3>Will a logo make my QR code unscannable?</h3>
      <p>Not if the generator uses high error correction and you keep the logo reasonably sized. Always test the final image on multiple phones before printing in bulk.</p>

